{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46772","headline":"荆渚寄怀西蜀无染大师兄 · 齐己","name":"荆渚寄怀西蜀无染大师兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大潙心付白崖前，宝月分辉照蜀天。\n圣主降情延北内，诸侯稽首问南禅。\n清秋不动骊龙海，红日无私罔象川。\n欲听吾宗旧山说，地边身老楚江边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}